---

---

<article
    class="w-full max-w-375 bg-[#F9FCFF] border border-[#BFD6EC] rounded-2xl mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 place-items-center px-10 py-12"
>
    <img
        src="/images/home/descubrimientodelmes.png"
        alt="Imagen del Libro del Mes"
        class="rounded-xl"
    />

    <div class="font-medium">
        <p class="text-xl md:text-3xl mb-3 mt-3">El Nombre del Viento</p>
        <p class="text-[#5B748E] md:text-lg">por Patrick Rothfus</p>

        <div class="flex flex-row mt-6">
            {
                Array.from({ length: 5 }).map(() => (
                    <svg
                        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                        width="24"
                        height="24"
                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                        fill="#0056A4"
                        class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-filled icon-tabler-star"
                    >
                        <>
                            <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none" />
                            <path d="M8.243 7.34l-6.38 .925l-.113 .023a1 1 0 0 0 -.44 1.684l4.622 4.499l-1.09 6.355l-.013 .11a1 1 0 0 0 1.464 .944l5.706 -3l5.693 3l.1 .046a1 1 0 0 0 1.352 -1.1l-1.091 -6.355l4.624 -4.5l.078 -.085a1 1 0 0 0 -.633 -1.62l-6.38 -.926l-2.852 -5.78a1 1 0 0 0 -1.794 0l-2.853 5.78z" />
                        </>
                    </svg>
                ))
            }

            <span class="ml-2">5.0</span>
        </div>

        <p class="text-[#5B748E] text-sm md:text-base mt-6">
            Kvothe, conocido como Reshi por los pocos que conocen su verdadero
            nombre, es el protagonista de su propia leyenda.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-6">
            <div class="w-full flex flex-row justify-between">
                <p class="text-sm">Total de Votos</p>
                <p class="text-[#0056A4] text-sm">342 Votos</p>
            </div>
            <div class="h-3 w-full bg-[#BED6ED] rounded-md mt-2">
                <div class="h-3 w-20 bg-[#0056A4] rounded-md"></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-row justify-center gap-5 mt-6">
            <button
                type="button"
                class="text-white text-sm md:text-lg w-full max-w-125 h-10 bg-[#01ACA5] rounded-lg"
                >Ver Detalles del Libro</button
            >
            <button
                type="button"
                class="text-[#5B748E] text-sm md:text-lg w-full max-w-45 h-10 bg-[#FBFDFF] border border-[#BFD6EC] rounded-lg"
                >Comprar Ahora</button
            >
        </div>
    </div>
</article>
